<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield close scores on Friday (first day of four):</p>
<p>Brisbane - Victoria 162 (Andrew Bichel 5-46). Queensland 100-1 (Trevor Barsby 51 not out).</p>
<p>Hobart - New South Wales 263-8 (Michael Slater 76, Brad McNamara 54 not out) v Tasmania.</p>
<p>Adelaide - South Australia 277 (Joe Scuderi 55). Western Australia 6-0.</p>
